<!--
  __ONBOARDING_2027__ First-launch onboarding (slides, house rules, notification ask,
  identity). Kept short on purpose: one idea per slide, one line of "why" per ask.

  Honesty rules for this file (and every translation of it):
  - OSHI has NO Tor. Never mention Tor or onion routing.
  - No "first", "only", "most secure" or other superlatives.
  - Offline reach is short (about 100 m phone to phone); say "nearby".
-->
